        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lakini mtu yeyote atakayekosa kwa makusudi, awe mwananchi au mgeni, atakuwa anamdhihaki Mwenyezi-Mungu, na ni lazima akatiliwe mbali miongoni mwa watu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana amekataa yale aliyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu na kuvunja mojawapo ya amri zake. Mtu huyo atakatiliwa mbali kabisa; na lawama ya kifo chake itakuwa juu yake mwenyewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja, wakati Waisraeli walipokuwa jangwani, walimwona mtu mmoja akiokota kuni siku ya Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mtu huyo akapelekwa mbele ya Mose, Aroni na jumuiya yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wao wakamweka kifungoni kwa sababu haikuwa bado imesemwa wazi namna ya kumfanya mtu wa namna hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Mtu huyo lazima auawe; jumuiya yote itampiga mawe nje ya kambi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, watu wakamtoa nje ya kambi, wakampiga mawe mpaka akafa, kama Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyomwamuru Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
